*A production-ready Django web application built for **Prasad Consultancy** (Pimpri, Pune) featuring dynamic tax regime estimators, real-time GST calculators, validated lead capture, and a Charcoal & Bronze Gold corporate design system.*

[Explore Live Web App 🚀](https://prasad-consultancy.onrender.com) • [Report Issue 🐛](https://github.com/D-Prasad19/tax_consultant_site/issues)

