---

## 🌟 Key Features & Functional Modules

### 🧮 1. Interactive Real-Time GST Calculator
- Engine supporting both **GST Exclusive** and **GST Inclusive** tax breakdowns.
- Real-time computing of CGST, SGST, Total Tax liability, and Gross Payable amounts.

### 📊 2. Income Tax Regime Estimator (Old vs. New)
- Comparative calculator evaluating gross annual income against eligible deductions (80C, 80D, HRA).
- Recommends optimal tax regime with visual savings badges.

### 📬 3. Validated Lead Generation & Inquiry System
- Contact form equipped with custom regex phone validation and message length sanitization.
- Automatic backend redirection to custom confirmation routing with data persistence in SQLite/PostgreSQL.

### 🔐 4. Production Security Hardening
- Built-in protection against **CSRF**, **XSS**, **Clickjacking**, and **SQL Injection**.
- WhiteNoise static asset compression with dynamic environment configurations.

### 🎨 5. Charcoal & Bronze Gold Design System
- Luxury corporate palette optimized with dynamic CSS variables.
- Fully responsive navigation overlay with mobile sticky call-to-action bars.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Architecture

- **Backend Framework:** Python 3.12+, Django 5.2.8
- **WSGI / Production Server:** Gunicorn 25.3.0
- **Static File Handling:** WhiteNoise 6.12.0
- **Frontend Stack:** HTML5, CSS3 (CSS Variables), JavaScript (ES6 Vanilla)
- **Environment Handling:** `python-dotenv` 1.2.2
- **Deployment Platform:** Render.com (Linux / Gunicorn WSGI)

---

## 📁 Project Directory Layout

```text
tax_consultant_site/
├── core/                       # Primary app: Views, Forms, Models & Routes
│   ├── admin.py                # Django Admin dashboard setup
│   ├── forms.py                # Regex form validation rules
│   ├── models.py               # ContactSubmission lead data model
│   ├── urls.py                 # Core routing configurations
│   └── views.py                # View handlers and email hooks
├── static/                     # Custom static assets
│   └── core/
│       ├── css/style.css       # Design system & responsive layout
│       └── js/main.js          # Calculators & interactive JS modules
├── templates/                  # Frontend HTML templates
│   ├── 404.html                # Custom 404 Page Not Found
│   ├── 500.html                # Custom 500 Server Error
│   └── core/                   # Base, index, about, calculator, contact, thank_you
├── tax_consultant_site/        # Project settings & WSGI configuration
├── .env                        # Environment variables (Ignored by Git)
├── .gitignore                  # Git tracking exclusion rules
├── manage.py                   # Django management script
├── Procfile                    # WSGI launch command for Gunicorn
└── requirements.txt            # Minimal Linux build dependencies
